{"id": "r08_57", "text": "Blue objects go in the right bin. So do the yellow ones. The red ones don't; they go in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "adv_so_do_ellipsis", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r08_58", "text": "For the red objects: cubes go left, cylinders go right, triangles go in the center. For the yellow and blue objects, everything goes in the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "adv_colour_scoped_shapes", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r08_59", "text": "Put all but the yellow and red objects in the center bin, and put those two colours in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "adv_all_but", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r08_60", "text": "The red triangle goes in the center bin. Apart from that, all red objects go in the right bin, while yellow and blue objects go in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "adv_apart_from_that", "adversarial": true}
